# ==============================================================================
# Environment Variables Configuration (Template)
# ==============================================================================
# This project is currently a self-contained static HTML/Tailwind CSS prototype
# and requires no secret API keys or database URLs to deploy on Vercel.
#
# If backend form handling or analytics are connected in future iterations,
# copy this file to `.env` locally and configure the keys in Vercel Dashboard:

# PUBLIC_SITE_URL="https://your-preview-url.vercel.app"
# CONTACT_FORM_WEBHOOK_URL=""

